+# MASTER7 918KISS H5 runtime contract gap
+
+Date: 2026-11-10  
+Scope: `918kiss_normal_myr`, `918kiss_normal_my1_1to100`, `918kiss_free_myr`
+
+## Finding
+
+The available source and handover evidence supports three isolated read-only
+catalogues. It does not contain an authoritative 918KISS H5 player, launch,
+wallet, transaction-query, session-closure, settlement or recovery contract.
+No executable adapter can be implemented safely from the current evidence.
+
+The existing gateway's `GetGameList` request and MD5 signing shape establish
+only the catalogue operation already implemented. They do not establish the
+operation name, fields, signing tail or result semantics of any runtime method.
+
+The gateway currently exposes only:
+
+```text
+GET /providers/918kissh5/games?account=normal
+GET /providers/918kissh5/games?account=my1
+GET /providers/918kissh5/games?account=free
+```
+
+The portal deliberately keeps all three profiles `adapter_unimplemented`,
+`enabled=false` and non-playable. The internal MY1 `unitScale=100` rule is a
+candidate platform conversion rule; it is not supplier confirmation that MY1
+means MYR at 1:100.
+
+## Evidence checked
+
+- Portal registry, catalogue, launch, wallet, acceptance and unit-conversion
+  code and tests.
+- Integration gateway 918KISS catalogue module, routes and tests.
+- All 84 uploaded attachments (including extracted DOCX, XLSX and PDF text),
+  repository documentation, handover files, acceptance CSVs, matching Git
+  material and 114 workspace archives containing `918KISS`, `KISS H5`,
+  `kissh5`, `MY1`, `opgateway` or the three account/profile labels.
+- `MASTER7_918KISS_验收记录_20261110.md`, which proves only `GetGameList` and
+  enumerates the absent runtime operations.
+- `MASTER7_918KISS_CATALOGUE_SAFETY_152.md`, which explicitly says the runtime
+  contracts have not been supplied or accepted.
+- `MASTER7_VENDOR_ACTIONS_20261107.md`, which asks the supplier for the missing
+  launch, wallet, query, exit, settlement, currency and account semantics.
+- `MASTER7_GAME_CONTRACT_DISCOVERY_20261110_MYT.json`, which marks Live22
+  kick/unfinished-round methods as another provider's compatibility reference;
+  they cannot be copied into a 918KISS adapter.
+
+Catalogue operator configuration and artwork URLs were not treated as runtime
+contract evidence. No supplier call, game launch, wallet movement or
+deployment was made during this audit.
+
+## Exact missing vendor fields
+
+The code exposes the same list as machine-readable, profile-isolated
+diagnostics in `lib/kissh5-contract-readiness.ts`. Values are never echoed by
+the validator.
+
+### Document provenance
+
+`document.document_id`, `document.api_version`, `document.environment`,
+`document.merchant_scope`, `document.base_urls`,
+`document.operation_names`, `document.ip_allowlist_rule`, `document.sha256`
+
+### Authentication and request signing
+
+`authentication.scheme`, `authentication.credential_fields`,
+`authentication.signature_algorithm`,
+`authentication.canonical_request_rule`, `authentication.signed_fields`,
+`authentication.timestamp_field`, `authentication.clock_skew_seconds`,
+`authentication.nonce_or_replay_rule`, `authentication.test_vectors`
+
+### Player registration and lookup
+
+`player.create.endpoint`, `player.create.method`,
+`player.create.required_fields`, `player.create.success_codes`,
+`player.create.error_codes`, `player.create.idempotency_rule`,
+`player.lookup.endpoint`, `player.lookup.method`,
+`player.lookup.required_fields`, `player.namespace_rule`
+
+### Game launch and return
+
+`launch.endpoint`, `launch.method`, `launch.required_fields`,
+`launch.response_url_field`, `launch.url_ttl_seconds`,
+`launch.return_url_field`, `launch.game_id_field`,
+`launch.session_id_field`, `launch.delivery_modes`, `launch.token_field`,
+`launch.token_expiry_rule`, `launch.token_revocation_rule`,
+`launch.success_codes`, `launch.error_codes`
+
+### Wallet balance and funds movement
+
+`wallet.mode`, `wallet.balance.endpoint`, `wallet.balance.method`,
+`wallet.balance.required_fields`, `wallet.balance.amount_field`,
+`wallet.balance.currency_field`, `wallet.funds_flow.operations`,
+`wallet.funds_flow.required_fields`,
+`wallet.funds_flow.transaction_id_field`,
+`wallet.funds_flow.idempotency_field`, `wallet.funds_flow.duplicate_rule`,
+`wallet.funds_flow.success_codes`, `wallet.funds_flow.error_codes`
+
+The supplier must first confirm `wallet.mode` as `transfer` or `seamless`.
+`wallet.funds_flow.operations` must then name the matching transfer operations
+or the matching wager/settle/cancel callbacks. A catalogue credential is not a
+wallet credential or wallet contract.
+
+### Transaction query and terminal states
+
+`wallet.transaction_query.endpoint`, `wallet.transaction_query.method`,
+`wallet.transaction_query.required_fields`,
+`wallet.transaction_query.pending_statuses`,
+`wallet.transaction_query.terminal_success_statuses`,
+`wallet.transaction_query.terminal_failure_statuses`,
+`wallet.transaction_query.not_found_rule`,
+`wallet.transaction_query.late_success_rule`,
+`wallet.transaction_query.binding_fields`
+
+### Callback and report contract
+
+`reports.endpoint`, `reports.method`, `reports.required_fields`,
+`reports.round_id_field`, `reports.bet_id_field`,
+`reports.transaction_id_field`, `reports.signed_fields`,
+`reports.source_ip_rule`, `reports.ack_schema`, `reports.retry_policy`,
+`reports.deduplication_field`, `reports.replay_window_seconds`,
+`reports.pagination_rule`, `reports.ordering_rule`
+
+### Exit and session closure
+
+`session.exit.endpoint`, `session.exit.method`,
+`session.exit.required_fields`, `session.exit.final_status_field`,
+`session.exit.success_codes`, `session.exit.error_codes`,
+`session.return_url_rule`, `session.disconnect_rule`,
+`session.duplicate_exit_rule`, `session.kick.endpoint`,
+`session.kick.method`, `session.kick.required_fields`,
+`session.offline_status.endpoint`, `session.offline_status.method`,
+`session.offline_status.required_fields`,
+`session.unfinished_rounds.endpoint`, `session.unfinished_rounds.method`,
+`session.unfinished_rounds.required_fields`,
+`session.issued_token_invalidation_rule`, `session.late_result_finality_rule`
+
+### Settlement and recovery
+
+`settlement.finality_rule`, `settlement.reversal_rule`,
+`settlement.reconciliation_fields`, `recovery.timeout_rule`,
+`recovery.retry_policy`, `recovery.polling_policy`
+
+### Limits, maintenance and acceptance vectors
+
+`limits.request_rate_rule`, `limits.amount_bounds_rule`,
+`maintenance.status_endpoint`, `maintenance.behavior`,
+`acceptance.uat_account_scope`, `acceptance.uat_test_cases`,
+`acceptance.production_vectors`
+
+### Fields required separately for every profile
+
+`profile.profile_id`, `profile.account_variant`,
+`profile.provider_account_scope`, `profile.provider_currency`,
+`profile.settlement_currency`, `profile.amount_unit`,
+`profile.amount_precision`, `profile.conversion_ratio`,
+`profile.rounding_rule`, `profile.balance_class`, `profile.game_scope`
+
+The required bindings are independent:
+
+| Portal profile | Account variant | Known label | Still requires supplier confirmation |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| `918kiss_normal_myr` | `normal` | MYR, cash | account scope, unit, precision, ratio, game scope and every runtime operation above |
+| `918kiss_normal_my1_1to100` | `my1` | MY1 label, cash | actual provider and settlement currencies, MY1 meaning, ratio, directions, rounding, game scope and every runtime operation above |
+| `918kiss_free_myr` | `free` | MYR, free credit | funding, spend, cash conversion, expiry, settlement, game scope and every runtime operation above |
+
+The MY1 profile additionally requires:
+
+`profile.my1_definition`, `profile.my1_to_myr_ratio`,
+`profile.conversion_direction`, `profile.conversion_rounding_rule`
+
+The free-credit profile additionally requires:
+
+`profile.free_credit_source`, `profile.free_credit_spend_rule`,
+`profile.free_credit_cash_conversion_rule`,
+`profile.free_credit_expiry_rule`, `profile.free_credit_settlement_rule`
+
+## Code change
+
+The new validator reports missing or malformed field names without reflecting
+submitted values. A syntactically complete documentation manifest still
+returns:
+
+```text
+documentationOnly = true
+adapterImplemented = false
+launchAllowed = false
+walletAllowed = false
+playAllowed = false
+```
+
+Production acceptance diagnostics now include the exact 918KISS contract gap
+for each profile. Existing acceptance evidence, catalogue success, credentials
+or an internal conversion test cannot enable Play.
+
+## Required next evidence
+
+Obtain the official versioned supplier documentation for each account scope,
+including sample request/response and error payloads, then have the provider
+confirm the merchant/environment binding in writing. Only after that evidence
+passes review should a disabled adapter be implemented and exercised in a
+non-money test environment. Production Play remains subject to separate launch,
+wallet, settlement, recovery and operational acceptance.
+
