+# MASTER7 V17.161 Readiness Hardening
+
+Release: `17.0.0-selfbuilt.161-readiness-hardening`
+
+This release keeps production payments and game launches closed while improving three independent readiness boundaries:
+
+- Company Bank: Bank Transfer remains separate from DuitNow QR. The QR option requires an enabled company account with actual QR artwork, and receipt submission returns a traceable order reference without automatically crediting a wallet.
+- 918KISS H5: three profile-isolated contract diagnostics enumerate the missing normal, MY1 1:100 and free-credit runtime fields. Catalogue evidence alone cannot make a profile playable.
+- JILI: availability, JP parsing, closure/finality and report-ledger semantics now fail closed unless independent documented evidence exists for each 1:1 and MY1 1:100 profile.
+
+No provider, payment, payout, game-launch or game-wallet capability is enabled by this release.
